                        en: "Based on the guidance of the Board of Directors, the management formulated and presented to the Board the business direction, a long-term strategic plan, an action plan and budget, and an annual workforce plan. The Board openly shared opinions and discussed them with the management to reach a mutual agreement before approval.",
